                "headline": "Marine Weather Statement issued September 17 at 9:58PM EDT by NWS Baltimore MD/Washington DC",
                "description": "A Marine Weather Statement has been issued for the following areas...\nChesapeake Bay north of Pooles Island MD...\n\nAt 957 PM EDT, Doppler radar indicated a gust front, capable of\nproducing winds to around 20 knots. This gust front was located\nalong a line extending from 16 nm north of Northeast River to 12 nm\nnorthwest of Havre De Grace to 25 nm northwest of Gunpowder River,\nmoving south at 30 knots.",
                "instruction": "Mariners can expect gusty winds to around 20 knots. Boaters should\nconsider seeking safe harbor.",
