                "headline": "Small Craft Advisory issued September 17 at 3:38PM EDT until September 17 at 11:00PM EDT by NWS Baltimore MD/Washington DC",
                "description": "* WHAT...South winds 10 to 15 kt with gusts up to 20 kt.\n\n* WHERE...Chesapeake Bay from Sandy Point MD to Smith Point VA,\nand Tangier Sound and the inland waters surrounding\nBloodsworth Island.\n\n* WHEN...Until 11 PM EDT this evening.\n\n* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.",
